### Тест очереди для RabbitMQ
# curl -X POST http://localhost:20080/api/orders
#  -H "Content-Type: application/json"
#  -d '{"user_id":1,"items":[{"product_name":"Book","price":"500.00","quantity":2}]}'
POST http://localhost:20080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": 1,
  "items": [
    {
      "product_name": "Book",
      "price": "500.00",
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ]
}

### В конце выполнения запустить воркера для прослушивания
docker compose exec app php yii queue/listen